    "culture": {
      "text": {
        "id": 40,
        "title": "Robert Pattinson is not enough: who should become the new Bond girl?",
        "source": "The Guardian - Culture",
        "source_id": "guardian_culture",
        "category": "culture",
        "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/nov/24/who-next-bond-girl-robert-pattinson",
        "published_at": "2026-11-24T10:00:13",
        "level": "C2",
        "slot_level": "C2",
        "source_level": "C2",
        "word_count": 1131,
        "duration_sec": null,
        "body_text": "After years of speculation, Robert Pattinson has been officially cast as James Bond for a new Amazon-produced film directed by Denis Villeneuve. There’s no release date for the project yet, though fall 2028 seems a likely target, given the release dates of all of the Pierce Brosnan and Daniel Craig installments.",
        "audio_url": null,
        "description": null,
        "license": "proprietary",
        "attribution": null,
        "truncated": true,
        "guid_hash": "9d6b557f066ad380181174ac0be58e19d51a3a5b",
        "summary": "With the British actor securing the role of James Bond, speculation has now begun over who should join him in Denis Villeneuve’s much-anticipated caper After years of speculation, Robert Pattinson has been officially cast as James Bond for a new Amazon-produced film directed by Denis Villeneuve. There’s no release date for the project yet, though fall 2028 seems a likely target, given the release dates of all of the Pierce Brosnan and Daniel Craig installments. This leaves plenty of time left on the clock for more speculation – namely, about who will be cast as the so-called Bond Girls for this rebooted installment. Past Bonds have usually been recognizable from earlier work, but none of them had yet reached Pattinson’s level of fame before actually playing Bond. Given that, in addition to sterling indie work for directors like David Cronenberg, Claire Denis and Lance Oppenheim, Pattinson has also been in Twilight, Batman and Christopher Nolan movies, he’s arguably already as famous as Brosnan and Craig were at their 007 peak. It must be this shift in the casting status quo that has inspired some predictions or hopes for a quantity as known as, say, Sydney Sweeney to play a Bond girl.",
        "origin": "fresh",
